      "comment": "ELLIE UNLEASHED (7) was never in contention last time after settling off pace at this track, but prior to that won comfortably by 5 lengths at this track (19.50) beating Aston Millicent in a Grade 5 on September 9. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with three wins from four starts. Better than last start and worth following up. SIX GINS (1) has missed the frame at her last two but did run well three back when second (21.92) in a Grade 5 at this track. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. WALLOON ROCKET (2) was unfavoured last start but led all the way to score by one length (19.79) at this track in a Grade 5 over 352m. Bold showing expected again. RUSTY ACES (3) is a last-start placegetter at this track and distance - should be thereabouts.",
